tps://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/java-archive","state":"uploaded","size":8930517,"digest":"sha256:7d662e8430cc585d7736762ed1ca8e85665f0c07ef5534006ffda045d65f8d3a","download_count":27733,"created_at":"2026-05-13T08:28:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T08:28:38Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/download/v1.3.6/Toolscreen-1.3.6-double-click-me.jar"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/tarball/v1.3.6","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/zipball/v1.3.6","body":"Setup video: https://youtu.be/YqS-fxPx_jo\r\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777\r\n\r\n# New Features\r\n- Added cursor to virtual cam\r\n- Added option to suppress caps lock state being triggered when using caps lock key\r\n- Added Brazilian Portuguese translations\r\n- Added color picker to mirror target color GUI\r\n- Added support for Modrinth App\r\n- Added a warning when attempting to install Toolscreen on Linux or Mac\r\n\r\n# Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed an issue with auto-update being blocked by Windows Defender\r\n- Fixed a bug with cursor position being desynced after resetting to wall while in thin mode\r\n- Fixed an issue with mode sometimes not resetting to Fullscreen when resetting with wall bypass\r\n- Fixed virtual cam showing \"only in game\" elements and not showing \"only in OBS\"\r\n- Fixed issues with releasing left shift vs right shift for hotkeys\r\n- Fixed background images not rendering in 26.1\r\n- Fixed F1 causing black screen in thin mode\r\n- Fixed blurry EyeZoom scaling in 26.1.2\r\n- Fixed opacity loss on layered images with borders\r\n- Fixed mirrors with opacity under 128 failing to render\r\n- Fixed stretched mirrors on raw output when a border thickness value is present\r\n\r\n# Changes\r\n- Improved instructions for ATLauncher installation (you must close the launcher while installing)\r\n- Changed \"Update Installed\" text from red to green\r\n- Increased injection timeout from 60s to 120s\r\n\r\nHow to update: download the .jar below, put it in the instance folder, and double click it\r\n# Patreon\r\nIf you would like to support the future development of Toolscreen, you can [subscribe through Patreon](<https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777>), your name will show up in the Supporters tab of Toolscreen and you get access to exclusive supporter Discord channels\r\n"}